ith added hallucinations. After that, rolls a d5 per turn to remove one of the 5 body senses, and finally, makes all Gear unusable and severs the Property/Essence link permanently \(if possible\) pe\rmanently, except if reversed through external items/methods.</span></p></body>)/Rect[32.1391 26.2438 248.596 83.8785]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj26 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Desperate Escape - In case of imminent danger, can activate this Ult to escape and immediately end any conflicts.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919173652-03'00')/NM(21be065b538a45e59a8a84bbd5301262)/Page 0/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Desperate Escape - In case of imminent danger, can activate this Ult to escape and immediately end any conflicts.</span></p></body>)/Rect[373.733 37.2139 573.828 83.2239]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj27 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(            0)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/NM(32e97419c2e44784aa5108032afb01f3)/Page 0/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p>            0</p></body>)/Rect[270.243 33.8336 336.843 46.0336]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj28 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(            --)/D